      "message": "Commenting here just to add weight to Leon\u0027s concerns about the safety of invoking this call when multithreading. \n\n@egdaniel@google.com I know we talked about handling a device lost bool for graphite in the past - did we land on a path forward there? If not, did you already have an idea of how we\u0027d like to do that or is it worth having a discussion about?",
