      "writtenOn": "2024-01-24T19:47:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So we are using InvokeDeviceLostCallback in both Ganesh and Graphite. Ganesh has not thread safety issues. With Graphite we could have two threads hitting this at the same time. So if we add a Mutex (which is probably right thing to do) it should be added here.\n\nWe haven\u0027t explicitly said how we\u0027d handle setting the bool here, but if we wrapped a mutex here I think it works for setting the lost bool as well making the callback.",
